    "summary": "Costs 1 CP. In the [Fight phase](vsdata:core-rule/fight-phase), react when an enemy picks its attacks’ targets. Of its targets, pick one of your units with either keyword: **KABAL**, **BLADES FOR HIRE**. Separately pick a friendly **DRUKHARI** unit without **VEHICLE**. Through phase end, when an attack would be allocated to a model in the first unit, measure [Engagement Range](vsdata:core-rule/engagement-range) from the attacking model to the second unit. If it is within range, skip the save. Use the attack’s Damage characteristic as the number of [mortal wounds](vsdata:core-rule/mortal-wounds) for the second unit.",
